# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:12
translate italian brandi0_c2ac7ef7:

    # "I go to Jackson Burger and start to walk up to the counter to put my order in with Jackson when a girl catches my attention out of the corner of my eye."
    "Vado da Jackson Burger e mi avvio verso il bancone per ordinare da Jackson quando una ragazza attira la mia attenzione con la coda dell’occhio."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:17
translate italian brandi0_fca97d2f:

    # "She is sitting with a laptop open on the table in front of her next to her burger, talking to the screen."
    "È seduta con un portatile aperto sul tavolo davanti a lei, accanto al suo hamburger, e sta parlando con lo schermo."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:20
translate italian brandi0_ac53ec27:

    # "She must have noticed me looking at her, because her head raises and her eyes shoot over to mine."
    "Deve aver notato che la stavo guardando, perché alza la testa e i suoi occhi si posano sui miei."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:21
translate italian brandi0_d172813e:

    # "Girl" "Hey."
    "Girl" "Ehi."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:22
translate italian brandi0_50c27c88:

    # "Girl" "Do you mind coming here for a minute? I won't bother you too long, I promise."
    "Girl" "Ti dispiace venire qui un attimo? Non ti darò fastidio a lungo, te lo prometto."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:23
translate italian brandi0_ee9dd18b:

    # pc "Uh, okay."
    pc "Ehm, va bene."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:26
translate italian brandi0_5035053f:

    # "I walk over to her booth and she scoots over a bit to give me room to sit down next to her."
    "Mi avvicino al suo tavolo e lei si sposta un po’ per farmi spazio e farmi sedere accanto a lei."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:28
translate italian brandi0_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/brandi 0_1.mp3'
    voice 'voices/brandi 0_1.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:29
translate italian brandi0_83069ce5:

    # fd "Hi, I'm Brandi. What's your name?"
    fd "Ciao, sono Brandi. Come ti chiami?"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:30
translate italian brandi0_55be1fd1:

    # pc "[pcname]."
    pc "[pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:32
translate italian brandi0_2a83a288:

    # "I recognize her then as the woman who had set the record for the most burgers eaten here on All-You-Can-Eat Sundays."
    "Allora la riconosco come la donna che aveva stabilito il record per il maggior numero di hamburger mangiati qui durante le domeniche “All-You-Can-Eat”."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:33
translate italian brandi0_6a2e96f3:

    # "How the hell did she eat 14 burgers?"
    "Come diavolo ha fatto a mangiare 14 hamburger?"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:36
translate italian brandi0_09a42674:

    # fd "Well [pcname], I do a food blog and three times a week, for my Kitch subscribers, I do these live dinners where I sit and chat with my followers while I eat some good food."
    fd "Beh [pcname], gestisco un blog di cucina e tre volte alla settimana, per i miei iscritti a Kitch, organizzo queste cene in diretta in cui mi siedo a chiacchierare con i miei follower mentre mangio del buon cibo."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:37
translate italian brandi0_900cc1e0:

    # pc "Wait, so they're just sitting at their computers watching you eat?"
    pc "Aspetta, quindi stanno semplicemente seduti davanti al computer a guardarti mentre mangi?"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:38
translate italian brandi0_8aa68273:

    # fd "Yeah there's nearly 600 people in chat right now. Say hi."
    fd "Sì, in questo momento ci sono quasi 600 persone in chat. Salutali."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:41
translate italian brandi0_73e58957:

    # pc "Uh, hi there."
    pc "Ehm, ciao a tutti."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:42
translate italian brandi0_d5bcf556:

    # fd "Everybody be nice to [pcname]. He's being a good sport."
    fd "Siate gentili con [pcname]. Sta dimostrando grande spirito."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:45
translate italian brandi0_2f36690d:

    # fd "So I've been telling everybody for a long time how this place has the best burgers in the world, but they don't believe me."
    fd "Allora, è da un bel po’ che dico a tutti che questo posto ha i migliori hamburger del mondo, ma non mi credono."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:46
translate italian brandi0_4454c371:

    # fd "I figured I'd grab the first random person who walked in the door and have them back up my claim."
    fd "Ho pensato di prendere la prima persona a caso che entrava dalla porta e farle confermare la mia affermazione."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:47
translate italian brandi0_9706e98a:

    # fd "They're the best, right?"
    fd "Sono i migliori, vero?"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:48
translate italian brandi0_97b1f955:

    # "Her eyes focus on mine, begging me to agree with her."
    "I suoi occhi si fissano sui miei, implorandomi di darle ragione."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:49
translate italian brandi0_4dab9b69:

    # "She doesn't even have to do that though. She is speaking truths."
    "Non ha nemmeno bisogno di farlo, però. Sta dicendo la verità."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:50
translate italian brandi0_3091c9ab:

    # pc "They definitely are."
    pc "Lo sono sicuramente."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:51
translate italian brandi0_866e846f:

    # pc "I don't know what kind of black magic fuckery Jackson does to make them taste so good,"
    pc "Non so che razza di magia nera usi Jackson per farli venire così buoni,"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:52
translate italian brandi0_8b6dd367:

    # pc "But this is seriously the best meat you'll ever put in your mouth."
    pc "Ma questa è davvero la carne più buona che mangerete mai."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:55
translate italian brandi0_c69ca1b2:

    # fd "Oh my gods. Haha, that's one way to put it."
    fd "Oh mio Dio. Haha, è un modo per dirlo."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:58
translate italian brandi0_51ca4011:

    # fd "I don't know about that though. I've had some pretty great meat in my mouth."
    fd "Non ne sono così sicuro, però. Ho mangiato della carne davvero ottima."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:59
translate italian brandi0_4b6dcd67:

    # "I suddenly realize the way that I had phrased that and I can feel my cheeks get red."
    "All’improvviso mi rendo conto di come l’ho formulata e sento le guance arrossire."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:60
translate italian brandi0_720edf84:

    # fd "Anyways, thanks for backing me up."
    fd "Comunque, grazie per avermi sostenuto."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:63
translate italian brandi0_57dba103:

    # fd "See guys. Best burgers in the world, right here in little Skyhill."
    fd "Vedete, ragazzi. I migliori hamburger del mondo, proprio qui nella piccola Skyhill."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:64
translate italian brandi0_c6c249ec:

    # fd "And with that, it's time for me to sign off. Thanks for hanging out with me and [pcname]."
    fd "E con questo, è ora che chiuda. Grazie per avermi seguito e [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:66
translate italian brandi0_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice 'voices/brandi 0_2.mp3'
    voice 'voices/brandi 0_2.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:67
translate italian brandi0_4ac0cb0a:

    # fd "Be sure you like, comment, and subscribe, and don't forget to ring that bell for notifications."
    fd "Assicuratevi di mettere “mi piace”, commentare e iscrivervi, e non dimenticate di attivare la campana per le notifiche."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:70
translate italian brandi0_326081b3:

    # fd "Say bye, [pcname]."
    fd "Dite ciao, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:71
translate italian brandi0_a9138891:

    # pc "Bye!"
    pc "Ciao!"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:76
translate italian brandi0_d41d8cd9_2:

    # voice 'voices/brandi_thanks2.mp3'
    voice 'voices/brandi_thanks2.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:77
translate italian brandi0_6583f806:

    # fd "Thanks again for helping me out with that. I'll buy you a burger."
    fd "Grazie ancora per avermi dato una mano. Ti offrirò un hamburger."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:81
translate italian brandi0_90fdbc67:

    # fd "That's what I always say!"
    fd "È quello che dico sempre!"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:82
translate italian brandi0_906d37ca:

    # fd "Anyways, I gotta get going. Hope you enjoy."
    fd "Comunque, devo andare. Spero che ti piaccia."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:84
translate italian brandi0_4e279127:

    # fd "Oh, well thanks for doing this for me anyways."
    fd "Oh, beh, grazie comunque per averlo fatto per me."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:85
translate italian brandi0_0260c184:

    # fd "Anyways, I gotta get going."
    fd "Comunque, devo andare."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:88
translate italian brandi0_29773f1e:

    # fd "I would, but I gotta run. I have somewhere to be in like ten minutes."
    fd "Lo farei, ma devo scappare. Devo essere da qualche parte tra una decina di minuti."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:92
translate italian brandi0_9645916f:

    # "I stand up and let her slide out of the booth."
    "Mi alzo e la lascio scivolare fuori dal separé."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:93
translate italian brandi0_c7c7ca8c:

    # fd "Hope I see you around again. You're a natural on the camera."
    fd "Spero di rivederti in giro. Sei a tuo agio davanti alla telecamera."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:94
translate italian brandi0_399bdc0f:

    # pc "Really?"
    pc "Davvero?"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:96
translate italian brandi0_7f04ba06:

    # fd "Hah, no, but still, I hope I see you again."
    fd "Ah, no, ma comunque spero di rivederti."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:97
translate italian brandi0_012dcbfd:

    # fd "If you want to check out my stream, I'm MagicMouth on Kitch, or you can just go to my website - www.brandiswallows.com."
    fd "Se vuoi dare un’occhiata alla mia diretta, mi chiamo MagicMouth su Kitch, oppure puoi semplicemente andare sul mio sito web: www.brandiswallows.com."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:98
translate italian brandi0_6b3f9108:

    # fd "See it's a double entendre."
    fd "Vedi, è un doppio senso."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:100
translate italian brandi0_9fa5f8e4:

    # fd "Because it's talking about me swallowing food, but also about me swallowing cum."
    fd "Perché si riferisce al fatto che ingoio il cibo, ma anche al fatto che ingoio lo sperma."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:101
translate italian brandi0_6a38101b:

    # fd "Get it?"
    fd "Capito?"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:102
translate italian brandi0_6221d019:

    # pc "I got it."
    pc "Ho capito."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:104
translate italian brandi0_f75f7c08:

    # fd "Okay, I gotta run. I'll see you around. Thanks again."
    fd "Ok, devo scappare. Ci vediamo in giro. Grazie ancora."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:105
translate italian brandi0_07c9c5ab:

    # pc "You're welcome."
    pc "Prego."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:106
translate italian brandi0_c2531072:

    # "With that, she grabs her laptop from the table and rushes out the door."
    "Detto questo, prende il portatile dal tavolo e si precipita fuori dalla porta."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:110
translate italian brandi0_d3463004:

    # "I eat the free burger that Brandi bought for me, then head back out to my car."
    "Mangio l’hamburger gratis che Brandi mi ha comprato, poi torno alla mia auto."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandi0.rpy:112
translate italian brandi0_3b75386f:

    # "I'm not really hungry, so I just head back out to my car."
    "Non ho molta fame, quindi torno semplicemente alla mia auto."

